{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32138","headline":"蒋侯神歌 · 温庭筠","name":"蒋侯神歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚神铁马金鸣珂，夜动蛟潭生素波。\n商风刮水报西帝，庙前古树蟠白虵。\n吴王赤斧斫云阵，画堂列壁丛霜刃。\n巫娥传意托悲丝，铎语琅琅理双鬓。\n湘烟刷翠湘山斜，东方日出飞神鸦。\n青云自有黑龙子，潘妃莫结丁香花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}